Data, Bishop, T-800, GERTY, TARS, Marvin)
@end itemize

Other franchises (e.g., @emph{Alien}, @emph{Blade Runner}, @emph{Ex
Machina}) remain acceptable if they fit the space-machine-AI register.

@item
@strong{Generic sci-fi / AI vocabulary} --- hyperspace, neural,
