network-facing, §4.1)
@item
@strong{Documents} --- specifications, prose guides, books, and document
deliverables produced per the @code{spacecraft-document-format} skill,
including the published Standard
 @tab @code{CC-BY-SA-4.0} by default (@code{CC-BY-4.0} permitted when a
