@node Project Posture
@chapter §5 — Project Posture
Spacecraft Software is a personal hobby project. This posture is the
@strong{default} for every project under the umbrella and is
non-negotiable. Individual projects may adopt a more open posture (see
§5.3) but never a more closed one.

§4 defines the formal license; this section defines the @strong{stated
stance} that sits alongside it. License says what the user @emph{may}
do; posture says what they should @emph{expect} from the maintainer.

