@node Manual Licensing
@section §8.5 — Licensing
Texinfo manuals are @strong{document-class} artifacts (§4.1.1) and
default to @strong{CC-BY-SA-4.0}. @strong{GFDL-1.3-or-later} is a
permitted alternative when the manual is distributed alongside
GPL-licensed software and compatibility with GNU documentation
collections is desired. Include the chosen license in @code{LICENSES/}
per §4.3.

